(7648085, 1243306, 156466, '<td valign="top">Thanks, all. I shot this the day I got my new Nikon 500mm. It was a perfect day to test it out - weather was good and birds, migrating and otherwise, were taking advantage of the wild grapes in the trees. Even with the 500mm this is a major crop in, but it''s something I haven''t been able to catch in years past. I''d say I got lucky on this shot but I actually moved from my usual spot on the deck in order to be able to see this Robin without any branches obscuring it. So I was half lucky. LOL</td>', 'Thanks, all. I shot this the day I got my new Nikon 500mm. It was a perfect day to test it out - weather was good and birds, migrating and otherwise, were taking advantage of the wild grapes in the trees. Even with the 500mm this is a major crop in, but it''s something I haven''t been able to catch in years past. I''d say I got lucky on this shot but I actually moved from my usual spot on the deck in order to be able to see this Robin without any branches obscuring it. So I was half lucky. LOL', '2019-12-10 11:29:27.000000', NULL, 0),
